 ## Background
-The method was introduced in the context of "SatGeo-NeRF," a NeRF model for satellite imagery that incorporates geometric regularization [S1]. It builds on the foundational NeRF rendering equations and adapts them to handle the specific challenges of satellite data, such as camera inaccuracies and the need for planar surface consistency [S1]. The approach was influenced by the need to align estimated normals with the gravity axis for better geometric regularization [S1].
